        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ddf117ad-bf1c-4aff-87a4-cb95fce52f3b).Image",
        "Description": "Your targets are Fanny, Janna, Joel and Phoebe Whites, children of the infamous druglord Charles White. The siblings were separated and given to foster families at an early age. Fanny and Janna were raised by Wyghts, a blue-collar couple, while Joel and Phoebe inherited Whytes&apos; love for luxurious lifestyle. They are about to meet in Dubai, and you won&apos;t let them. The client states the targets must be eliminated as loud as possible to send Charles a message. Make sure they go with a bang, 47.",
